# Chapter I gives Runeclaw Bear (2/2) for nothing; Raging Goblin (1/1) is paid for. Chapter II (turn 3): three +1/+1 counters
# on a target creature you control, so the Bear is 5/5 (the Goblin stays 1/1), and Bot2's Ornithopter is not a legal target. Chapter III (turn 5): double the Bear's power
# and toughness (+5/+5, so 10/10) and trample until end of turn, then the Saga is sacrificed. Next turn the Bear is 5/5 again
# with no trample.

